### 6. GitHub Actions Workflow (CI)

The workflow runs three jobs:

1. **ui-test** – spins up the frontend + backend (via `docker-compose`) and runs Cypress.
2. **unit-test** – runs Jest on the backend code.
3. **performance-test** – spins up the backend (same compose) and executes the k6 script, asserting the latency threshold.

All jobs use the same `docker-compose.yml` (shown after the workflow) to guarantee identical environments.

